    "title": "1 hurt in crash involving Boston police cruiser - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By 7 News WHDH ,\n2 hours ago BOSTON (WHDH) - One person was hurt in a crash involving a Boston police cruiser Wednesday night, Boston police said. Boston police responded to the intersection of Shawmut Avenue and Melnea Cass Boulevard at approximately 7:30 p.m. for a report of a crash. Police said one person was hurt and taken to the hospital. Read full article",
